<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 209 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 594.647982 538.587036 745.252978 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure1) /TU (Flowchart illustrating a six-step process: Initial Information Gathering uses Excel surveys to collect data. Automated Ingestion transforms Excel to CSV and JSON via Python. LLM-Assisted Semantic Mapping aligns domain terms using EMMO and QUDDT, creating enriched CSV. Iterative Expert Validation involves reviewing and revising by experts. Formal Ontology Generation refines CSV and JSON into OWL using a Python script. Publication and Dissemination occur through a persistent URL for distribution.) /Type /Annot >>
